@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - ATM System

[*] --> Arrival

state "Arrival" as Arrival
state "PIN Verification" as PINVerification
state "Invalid Card or PIN" as InvalidCardOrPin
state "Options Selection" as OptionsSelection
state "Request Processing" as RequestProcessing
state "Cancel Operation" as CancelOperation

Arrival : entry / User arrives at the ATM
Arrival --> PINVerification

PINVerification : entry / User enters PIN
PINVerification : do / Verify PIN
PINVerification : exit / Correct PIN or incorrect PIN

PINVerification -->|1| InvalidCardOrPin : Incorrect PIN
PINVerification -->|2| OptionsSelection : Correct PIN

InvalidCardOrPin : entry / Card is invalid or too many attempts
InvalidCardOrPin : do / Keep card for security
InvalidCardOrPin : exit / Operation cancelled

CancelOperation : entry / User cancels operation
CancelOperation : do / Return card to user
CancelOperation : exit / Operation completed

OptionsSelection : entry / User selects option
OptionsSelection : do / Display available options
OptionsSelection : exit / Options displayed

RequestProcessing : entry / User makes a choice
RequestProcessing : do / Process selected request
RequestProcessing : exit / Request processed

[*] --> CancelOperation
CancelOperation --> [*]

PINVerification -->|1| InvalidCardOrPin
PINVerification -->|2| OptionsSelection

OptionsSelection --> RequestProcessing

InvalidCardOrPin --> [*]
RequestProcessing --> [*]

@enduml
